# clasp push whitelist: ignore EVERYTHING, then allow only the real Apps Script project files.
# Without this, clasp would try to push the Node test .js files, every .md, and all the other
# .html templates (delivery/deploy/thumbnail/variants) into the Apps Script project. Verify what
# will actually push with:  npm run clasp:status
**/**

!appsscript.json
!Code.gs
!Api.gs
!db.gs
!setup.gs
!Tests.gs
!WebApp.html
!Sidebar.html
